ok - the snapshot passes the contract and each rule family's call is withheld whole
ok - the snapshot carries underway, charted, and landed work from bearings
ok - recorded options reach the card before reconcile and pass the text check
ok - every card carries the contract's card_hash
ok - every card and work row carries repo, null when no repository is found
ok - every main-home card and work row carries owner (main)
